================================================================================
 Antfarm
================================================================================

Antfarm is the companion this repository adds. It is:

    antfarm/                        the Python engine, dashboard and chat bridge
    game/hack/scripts/antfarm_*.lua the in-game DFHack scripts
    tests/                          the test suite and the df/dfhack stub
    docs/, tools/*.sh, start_antfarm.sh, README.md, AGENTS.md
    game/dfhack-config/init/*.init  and the Antfarm entries in game/data/init/

Everything else in this repository is redistributed upstream software and is
covered by its own licence, reproduced in full below.

Antfarm is released under the zlib licence -- the same licence as DFHack and
df-ai, the two projects it builds on and ports from, so that code can move
between them without friction.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

