================================================================================
 REDISTRIBUTED SOFTWARE
================================================================================

This repository ships Dwarf Fortress, DFHack and four companion utilities so
that the whole thing runs without a separate install. None of it is ours. The
terms below are reproduced verbatim from the files that ship with each package.

Bay 12's terms permit redistribution of Dwarf Fortress only free of charge; this
repository is distributed free of charge and is not sold, bundled with anything
sold, or placed behind any payment.


