================================================================================
 4. BUNDLED UTILITIES (tools/)
================================================================================

--- Dwarf Therapist -------------------------------------------------------------

Copyright (c) 2009, 2010 Trey Stout (chmod), and subsequent maintainers.
MIT licence; the full text ships at tools/share/doc/LICENSE.txt.

--- Legends Browser -------------------------------------------------------------

Legends Browser, by Markus Riegel (robertjanetzko) and contributors.
https://github.com/robertjanetzko/LegendsBrowser -- MIT licence.

--- SoundSense-RS ---------------------------------------------------------------

SoundSense-RS by prixt, a Rust reimplementation of SoundSense by zwei.
https://github.com/prixt/soundsense-rs -- MIT licence.
The soundpacks it plays are by the SoundSense community and carry their own
terms; none are bundled here.

--- Announcement Window+ --------------------------------------------------------

Announcement Window+ by ldog/Rose and contributors.
See tools/announcement/readme.md.


